      "message": "test(app): pin the tilt-head rotary turn before the G01 approach\n\nReview item 4 of #3499. A leaning 5-Axis Contour generates on\nassets/machines/tilthead.mch and posts with assets/posts/fanuc.cps.\nThe opening rotary turn must post on G00 at the clearance plane, and\nthe G01 approach that follows must carry no rotary words.\n\nRefs #3414\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
